{
  "_description": "Inverse-volatility allocation on an 11-ETF multi-asset universe, rebalanced monthly. Compares three volatility forecasts (EWMA, rolling, GARCH) against an equal-weight baseline on the same universe. All ETFs listed by 2004, so 2007 onward has full data.",
